<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rex Stores rating raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rex Stores rating raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said on Tuesday it raised its six-month intermediate term rating on Rex Stores Corp to outperform from market performer.</p>
<p>--It said it views Rex's stock as a value since it recently fell below its book value of $11.10 and is trading at its historical relative low PE.</p>
<p>--EVEREN's EPS estimates for the Q3 OF FY97 are $0.14 versus $0.21 in the prior period and $1.50 for FY97 and $1.75 for FY98.</p>
<p>--Rex was unchanged at 10-7/8.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
